        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaami be Baamori boosi be mumbo mwa Yoritani, ne babaami be Bakanaani boosi sia nyanja eya Mediterenia baulila bali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi omisie Yoritani khukhwola nga babaandu ba Isiraeli ne bambukha. Sikila kano, babaami abo baria ne khuyengukha kimiooyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhebwa e Kilikali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu siise esio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yoshua ali, “Khola kimibano kie kamabaale mala okhebe Baisiraeli sisiingilo sikhola khabili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yoshua akhola kimibano kie kamabaale mala aakhebela Baisiraeli a Kibea-haaraloti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sino nisio sifuno sisiakila Yoshua abakheba: babaandu be siseecha boosi babaama Misiri, babaandu be siseecha boosi banamae, bafwila khu ngila mu sichiimi, enyuma we khurura e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba babaandu boosi ba baarura e Misiri ne baba ne bakhebwa, babasaalwa khu ngila mu sichiimi baba basiinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 14.28-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baisiraeli bakeenda mu sichiimi khu miiko kamakhumi kane. Mu biise ebio, babaandu boosi be liie bafwa sikila se baria Wele tawe. Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi echuba ali se balibona sibala nisio kamabeele ne bubuukhi biseleetekhanga nisio alaka ali alielesia bakuuka babwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaana be babaandu bano bali nibo Yoshua akheba sikila se bakhebwa ne bali khu lukeendo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we khumala siikhebo, ekholo yoosi yarama mu kambi khukhwola nga baona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yoshua ali, “Luno namurusiisiekho chisoni che khuuba ba nasioobi mu Misiri.” Elio liliakila abuundu ne alaangwa Kilikali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kilikali:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liboola lili “rusibwao.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " khukhwola luno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
